e-blind study with dipyridamole and aspirin</article-title><source>Arthritis Rheum</source><year>1984</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>1137</fpage><lpage>1143</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6386002</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b9-wjem-9-0043"><label>9</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Denton</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>Howell</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Stratton</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Long-term low molecular weight heparin therapy for severe Raynaud&#x02019;s phenomenon: a pilot study</article-title><source>Clin Exp Rheumatol</source><year>2000</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>499</fpage><lpage>502</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10949727</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b10-wjem-9-0043"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>La Civita</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Pitaro</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Rossi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Gambini</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Guiggioli</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Cini</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Ferri</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Amlodipine in the treatment of Raynaud&#x02019;s phenomenon. A double-blind placebo-controlled crossover study</article-title><source>Clin Drug Invest</source><year>1997</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>126</fpage><lpage>131</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b11-wjem-9-0043"><label>11</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rhedda</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>McCans</surname><given-names>J</given